<headroom-library version="1" id="crunch-small-box" category="Crunch" order="160" instrument="guitar" style="Indie Rock">
  <description>A handwired 15-watt EL84 1x12 turned up to where it's just starting to grind: bedroom-to-club crunch that's bouncy, a bit bassy and very touch-sensitive, with a small room around it. Strum lightly for chime, hit harder for grit; great for indie rhythm and riffy leads.</description>
  <tags><tag>Crunch</tag><tag>Indie Rock</tag><tag>Class-A</tag><tag>Rhythm</tag><tag>Low wattage</tag></tags>
  <sources>
